			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hi all Zylah from KoH here. Well while i usually dont get involved when peeps go elsewhere after reading this post i find it a must that i post.  Especially when the peep applying thinks its ok to bash my guild as a way to get pity on a app! Lets start off with the truth for starters, Armageddon was lent 20k by a guildy prior to being level 60 on the condition that he would pay back the guildy before he dinged 60, the guildy reached level 64 and still had'nt been paid! After months of asking for his money and  being sent tells over the months, i  spoke to  armageddon and the guildy and asked when he could pay , arms response was he didnt have any money,  even though the night prior i had given him 18k and he had been awarded an 80k loot. Enough was enuff as it was obvious he had no intentions to pay back the guildy, heck he was busy twinking his alts he said, so he was basically forced to pay back the guildy which really bothered him since  borrowing money is much more fun  if you never intend on paying the guildy back, p.  Shortly after paying back the money and  moaning and groaning,  he sits in guild chat and verbally abuses a guildy over a pair of 3k gloves  which he never recived, but in fact had given to another guildy to hold, even then the guildy felt bad about  it and opted to pay him so that all would know that the nasty things arm said werent true.  All in all i cant say Arm will be a loss he has poor raid attendance if any, group memebers constanly die with him in group since he thinks grouping is going afk  for hours at a time while he soaks up xp, and as far as being  about a guild i have to say when youre rolling against guildies who can actually use an item and then turn around and try and sell it to guildies for a profit well that pretty much sums you up, ex.. runes which at 64 i doubt you can use, wos items etc etc . Sorry for the flame  on your board CoTW but the truth must be told about this app. 
<br />

<br />
 Zylah Noble'Blade ( KoH Officer)<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /></div></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
